id=byd_hk_tunnel
name=BYD HK cloud tunnel
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=ak
description=Routes the BYD cloud daemons' APN3 TCP traffic through a WireGuard tunnel to a Hong Kong relay; BYD's cloud only accepts CN/HK source IPs on the T-Box, CAN-upload and account ports. Userspace WireGuard (bydwg), policy routing, 60 s watchdog.
